Warning is what gives you the digits 1-5 that indicate dangerous 
monsters you can't otherwise detect.  Some classes get it by levelling 
up, or you can get it from a ring.  (See the wiki for any other ways).

Seeing the phrase out of context made me realise how confusing it could 
be, though I always interpreted it as an intrinsic, rather than meaning 
someone had told me not to do something.

